ADVERTISEMENT FOR BIDS

Sealed bids will be received by the Moon Area School District, 8353 University Boulevard, Moon
Township, PA 15108, until 2:00 PM prevailing time on October 27, 2026, at which time they will be
publicly opened and read, for General, HVAC, Plumbing and Electrical prime contracts for the Moon
Area School District natatorium renovation.

Bids must be accompanied by a bid bond in the amount of 10% of the bid. Performance and payment
bonds will be required. Prevailing wage rates as determined by the Pennsylvania Department of Labor
and Industry apply to this project. Bidders must comply with the District's MBE/WBE participation
goals.

A mandatory pre-bid conference will be held October 13, 2026 at 10:00 AM at the natatorium.

The District reserves the right to reject any or all bids.
